<title>AUSTRALIA: Australis says director Falloon resigns.</title>
<headline>Australis says director Falloon resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pay television operator Australis Media Ltd said on Monday Nick Falloon has resigned as a director of the company.</p>
<p>Falloon is also a director of Publishing and Broadcasting Ltd (PBL).</p>
<p>PBL said on Friday it planned to sell part of its economic interest in Australis to the owners of rival pay TV group, News Corp Ltd and Telstra Corp Ltd  as part of a wider plan to rationalise the industry.</p>
<p>Australis said Falloon had resigned due to potential conflicts relating to the PBL announcement.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
